# Tesseract language data downloaded on first OCR run (~5MB)
*.traineddata
*.traineddata.gz
.cache/

# Face model weights (~12MB), copied out of @vladmandic/face-api by
# `npm run setup:face`. A build product, not source: committing them would put
# megabytes into every clone forever, for files the package already ships.
# See scripts/setup-face-models.mjs.
public/models/

# The SFace engine: two ONNX models (~9.5MB) plus the onnxruntime wasm build
# (~13.6MB), fetched by `npm run setup:face:sface`. Same reasoning — and these are
# not even on npm, so a clone without the setup step simply has no SFace engine.
public/onnx/

# A whole PGlite data directory copied by hand beside the app. The app's own
# snapshots live in backups/, which is ignored above; these hand-made copies
# were not, so a `git add -A` would have swallowed 50MB+ of database.
.cafetrack-backup-*/

